cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the two articles listed under references."
title: "pSTAM Design Toolbox"
abstract: "A desktop toolbox for the data-driven design of Pneumatic Silicone Tube Artificial Muscles (pSTAM): ANN surrogates of measured static contraction, inflation time and deflation time, inverted by particle-swarm optimisation over muscle length, outer diameter, wall thickness and actuation pressure."
